Hello Robert,


Thank you for reaching out to our office. Reports from constituents like yo=
urself are crucial to inform our legislative and oversight priorities. Your=
 information has been forwarded to the appropriate staff for review. They w=
ill follow-up with you directly if they see a path forward for assistance.

Thank you again for your time!



________________________________
