n-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_=
MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb=
(0,0,0)">
Attached is my letter of September 23, 2026.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; margi=
n-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_=
MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb=
(0,0,0)">
An Oregon State Police detective who also serves as a task force officer wi=
th the Portland FBI Joint Terrorism Task Force distributed my name to FBI p=
ersonnel, then moved my driver's record and a report about me from his FBI =
account into a state case file he
 had declared, in writing two days earlier, was not an FBI case. The matter=
 never had a criminal predicate. The state's own file closed with &quot;the=
re is no evidence White has committed any crimes.&quot;</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; margi=
n-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_=
MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb=
(0,0,0)">
I am asking what authority permitted the March 13, 2026 transfer, what the =
FBI created and retains about me, and who audits the movement of informatio=
n across the state-federal seam by dual-role officers.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; margi=
n-bottom:1em; font-family:Aptos,&quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos_=
MSFontService&quot;,Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif; font-size:12pt; color:rgb=
(0,0,0)">
I am your constituent. Every fact in the letter is cited to the Oregon Stat=
e Police production of September 3, 2026, which is public in full at oprdvo=
lunteerabuse.org.</div>
<div class=3D"elementToProof" style=3D"direction:ltr; margin-top:1em; margi=
